# ---- Research / data-curation artifacts (not needed to run the app) ----
# Root-level research pipeline (step*.py, commons_*.py, etc.) and downloaded
# source data. The running app only needs data inside
# backend/src/main/resources/data/ and the built frontend in
# backend/src/main/resources/static/. These root files were used once to
# generate that dataset and are not part of the runtime artifact.
/*.py
/*.txt
/*.json
/*.xml
/*.pdf
/*.html
Research/
_research/
apicache/
.workbuddy-ai/
maven.zip

# ---- Archives / large local artifacts ----
*.zip
*.gz
